OL,3,GNEWSADisbelief as 'most important item'
OL,4,Afound under bed
OL,5,
OL,6,FAuctioneer Andrew Stowe said: "Hands
OL,7,Fdown, it's the most important item
OL,8,Fwe've ever sold. When I unwrapped it, I
OL,9,Fcouldn't believe it."
